{
  "kind": "html",
  "caption": "把先修关系 [a,b] 画成有向边 b → a，并统计每门课的入度。不断学习入度为 0 的课程，同时删除它发出的边；若最终学习数等于课程总数，则返回 true，否则剩余依赖中存在环 (也可能包括被环阻塞的后续课程)，返回 false。动画依次演示示例 1 的顺利完成和示例 2 的环依赖。",
  "html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>课程表可视化题解</title>\n<style>\n  * { box-sizing: border-box; }\n  html, body{ margin: 0; background: #1c1c1c; color: #d4d4d4; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"PingFang SC\", sans-serif; font-size: 15px; }\n  body{ padding: 24px; }\n  main{ width: 100%; max-width: 980px; margin: 0 auto; }\n  h1 { margin: 0 0 10px; color: #fff; font-size:14px; }\n  p { margin: 0; line-height: 1.7; }\n  .mono, .num { font-family: \"SF Mono\", Monaco, Menlo, monospace; }\n  .summary { color: #aaa; }\n  .panel { margin-top: 24px; padding: 20px; border: 1px solid #444; border-radius: 12px; background: #252526; }\n  .panel-head { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; margin-bottom: 20px; }\n  .example { color: #3794ff; font-weight: 700; font-size: 17px; }\n  .step-badge { padding: 6px 10px; border-radius: 6px; background: #333; color: #ddd; }\n  .graph { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: center; justify-content: center; gap: 14px; min-height: 112px; padding: 20px; border-radius: 10px; background: #181818; }\n  .course { min-width: 106px; padding: 12px; border: 2px solid #666; border-radius: 9px; background: #2d2d30; text-align: center; transition: .35s ease; }\n  .course .num { display: block; color: #fff; font-size:14px; font-weight: 700; }\n  .course .label { display: block; margin-top: 6px; color: #aaa; font-size: 13px; }\n  .course.active { background: #0e639c; border-color: #3794ff; }\n  .course.active .num { color: #fff; }\n  .course.done { background: #173c2c; border-color: #4ec9b0; opacity: .75; }\n  .course.blocked { background: #5a2424; border-color: #f48771; }\n  .arrow { display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; min-width: 100px; gap: 5px; color: #999; }\n  .arrow-line { color: #3794ff; font-family: \"SF Mono\", Monaco, Menlo, monospace; font-size:14px; }\n  .arrow.removed { opacity: .2; text-decoration: line-through; }\n  .details { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(230px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; margin-top: 18px; }\n  .card { min-height: 105px; padding: 16px; border: 1px solid #444; border-radius: 9px; background: #2d2d30; }\n  .card-title { margin-bottom: 10px; color: #9cdcfe; font-weight: 700; }\n  .values { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 8px; }\n  .chip { padding: 7px 10px; border-radius: 5px; background: #3a3a3a; font-family: \"SF Mono\", Monaco, Menlo, monospace; }\n  .chip.hot { background: #0e639c; color: #fff; }\n  .status { margin-top: 18px; padding: 14px 16px; border-left: 4px solid #3794ff; background: #202f40; line-height: 1.6; }\n  .status.fail { border-color: #f48771; background: #402626; }\n  .legend { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 14px; margin-top: 20px; color: #aaa; font-size: 13px; }\n  .dot { display: inline-block; width: 12px; height: 12px; margin-right: 6px; border-radius: 3px; vertical-align: -1px; background: #0e639c; }\n  .dot.done { background: #173c2c; border: 1px solid #4ec9b0; }\n  .dot.blocked { background: #5a2424; border: 1px solid #f48771; }\n  @media (max-width: 620px) {\n    body{ padding: 16px; }\n    .panel { padding: 16px; }\n    .graph { flex-direction: column; }\n    .arrow { min-height: 64px; justify-content: center; }\n    .arrow-line { transform: rotate(90deg); }\n  }\n  /* COMPACT */ html,body{font-size:12px!important;line-height:1.45!important}body{padding:8px 10px 10px!important}main{max-width:560px!important;margin:0 auto!important}h1{font-size:14px!important;margin:0 0 4px!important;color:#d4d4d4!important}p,.summary{font-size:12px!important;color:#8d8d8d!important}.panel{padding:8px 10px!important;border-radius:6px!important;margin-top:8px!important;border:1px solid #3c3c3c!important}.example{font-size:13px!important}.step-badge{padding:2px 7px!important;border-radius:4px!important;font-size:10px!important}.graph{min-height:72px!important;padding:8px 10px!important;border-radius:6px!important}.course{min-width:68px!important;padding:8px!important;border-width:1px!important;border-radius:6px!important}.course .num{font-size:13px!important}.course .label{font-size:10px!important;color:#8d8d8d!important}.details{gap:6px!important;margin-top:8px!important}.card{padding:8px 10px!important;min-height:auto!important;border-radius:6px!important}.chip{padding:2px 7px!important;border-radius:4px!important;font-size:11px!important}.status{border-left-width:3px!important;padding:8px 10px!important;margin-top:8px!important;font-size:12px!important}.legend{font-size:10px!important;margin-top:8px!important;gap:8px!important}\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main>\n  <h1>用拓扑排序检查先修关系</h1>\n  <p class=\"summary\">边从先修课指向后续课。每轮只学习当前入度为 <span class=\"mono\">0</span> 的课程。</p>\n\n  <section class=\"panel\">\n    <div class=\"panel-head\">\n      <div id=\"example\" class=\"example\"></div>\n      <div id=\"stepBadge\" class=\"step-badge\"></div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"graph\">\n      <div id=\"course0\" class=\"course\">\n        <span class=\"num\">0</span><span id=\"label0\" class=\"label\">课程 0</span>\n      </div>\n      <div id=\"arrow\" class=\"arrow\">\n        <span id=\"edgeText\" class=\"mono\"></span>\n        <span id=\"arrowLine\" class=\"arrow-line\">→</span>\n      </div>\n      <div id=\"course1\" class=\"course\">\n        <span class=\"num\">1</span><span id=\"label1\" class=\"label\">课程 1</span>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"details\">\n      <div class=\"card\">\n        <div class=\"card-title\">当前入度</div>\n        <div class=\"values\">\n          <span id=\"degree0\" class=\"chip\"></span>\n          <span id=\"degree1\" class=\"chip\"></span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"card\">\n        <div class=\"card-title\">可学习队列</div>\n        <div id=\"queue\" class=\"values\"></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"card\">\n        <div class=\"card-title\">已学习数量</div>\n        <div id=\"learned\" class=\"mono\" style=\"font-size:14px;color:#fff\"></div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div id=\"status\" class=\"status\"></div>\n    <div class=\"legend\">\n      <span><i class=\"dot\"></i>本轮处理</span>\n      <span><i class=\"dot done\"></i>已经学习</span>\n      <span><i class=\"dot blocked\"></i>被环阻塞</span>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n</main>\n<script>\nconst frames = [\n  { ex:'示例 1：prerequisites = [[1,0]]', step:'1 / 3　建图', edge:'先修关系 0 → 1', d0:0, d1:1, q:['0'], learned:'0 / 2', c0:'active', c1:'', removed:false, text:'课程 0 入度为 0，先进入队列。', fail:false },\n  { ex:'示例 1：prerequisites = [[1,0]]', step:'2 / 3　学习课程 0', edge:'删除边 0 → 1', d0:0, d1:0, q:['1'], learned:'1 / 2', c0:'done', c1:'active', removed:true, text:'学习课程 0 后删除它的出边，课程 1 的入度降为 0。', fail:false },\n  { ex:'示例 1：prerequisites = [[1,0]]', step:'3 / 3　完成', edge:'所有边均已删除', d0:0, d1:0, q:[], learned:'2 / 2', c0:'done', c1:'done', removed:true, text:'共学习 2 门课程，等于 numCourses，因此返回 true。', fail:false },\n  { ex:'示例 2：prerequisites = [[1,0],[0,1]]', step:'1 / 2　发现环', edge:'0 ⇄ 1', d0:1, d1:1, q:[], learned:'0 / 2', c0:'blocked', c1:'blocked', removed:false, text:'两门课程的入度都为 1，没有任何课程能进入初始队列。', fail:true },\n  { ex:'示例 2：prerequisites = [[1,0],[0,1]]', step:'2 / 2　无法完成', edge:'循环依赖仍然存在', d0:1, d1:1, q:[], learned:'0 / 2', c0:'blocked', c1:'blocked', removed:false, text:'队列已空，但仍有课程未学习，说明图中存在环，返回 false。', fail:true }\n];\nlet index = 0;\nfunction render() {\n  const f = frames[index];\n  document.getElementById('example').textContent = f.ex;\n  document.getElementById('stepBadge').textContent = f.step;\n  document.getElementById('edgeText').textContent = f.edge;\n  document.getElementById('degree0').textContent = '课程 0：' + f.d0;\n  document.getElementById('degree1').textContent = '课程 1：' + f.d1;\n  document.getElementById('degree0').className = 'chip' + (f.d0 === 0 && !f.c0.includes('done') ? ' hot' : '');\n  document.getElementById('degree1').className = 'chip' + (f.d1 === 0 && !f.c1.includes('done') ? ' hot' : '');\n  const queue = document.getElementById('queue');\n  queue.innerHTML = f.q.length ? f.q.map(x => '<span class=\"chip hot\">课程 ' + x + '</span>').join('') : '<span class=\"chip\">空</span>';\n  document.getElementById('learned').textContent = f.learned;\n  document.getElementById('course0').className = 'course ' + f.c0;\n  document.getElementById('course1').className = 'course ' + f.c1;\n  document.getElementById('arrow').className = 'arrow' + (f.removed ? ' removed' : '');\n  document.getElementById('arrowLine').textContent = f.fail ? '⇄' : '→';\n  const status = document.getElementById('status');\n  status.className = 'status' + (f.fail ? ' fail' : '');\n  status.textContent = f.text;\n  index = (index + 1) % frames.length;\n}\nrender();\nsetInterval(render, 2200);\n</script>\n</body>\n</html>",
  "svg": "",
  "media": "",
  "time_complexity": "O(V + E)",
  "space_complexity": "O(V + E)",
  "complexity_note": "V 是课程数, E 是先修关系数. 入度拓扑排序让每门课程最多出队一次、每条边处理一次; 邻接表占 O(V + E), 入度数组和队列占 O(V)."
}
